Patches applied to the pristine exfatprogs-1.4.5 tarball by ../unpack.sh.

They apply with `patch -p1` from inside src/, in filename order.  Each one
starts with a few lines of prose saying what it does and why, then the diff.

  0001-no-kernel-version-check.patch
        The device is opened without a kernel version test on the uname()
        release (which is the LikeOS version here).

  0002-no-o-direct-ebadfd.patch
        The read-back check of mkfs.exfat -C reads without O_DIRECT, and
        EBADF stands in for EBADFD: the LikeOS libc has neither.

